1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:06,299
Station 2891: an Arctic research base where you never, ever let go of the guide

2
00:00:06,299 --> 00:00:06,679
line.

3
00:00:06,899 --> 00:00:08,648
Here's how the location plays.

4
00:00:09,467 --> 00:00:13,637
Put the Helicopter card near the board and the Helicopter token on its exit space.

5
00:00:13,637 --> 00:00:17,147
Place the Skidozer token in any outdoor space next to a search space.

6
00:00:17,367 --> 00:00:21,094
And before building the Item decks, find a Two-Way Radio and put it in your

7
00:00:21,094 --> 00:00:21,591
inventory.

8
00:00:22,400 --> 00:00:26,095
The five outside spaces, including the Helicopter exit, are Outdoor.

9
00:00:26,095 --> 00:00:27,563
Everything else is indoors.

10
00:00:27,783 --> 00:00:31,965
The Main Building is every indoor space except the Commander's Hut and the Tool

11
00:00:31,965 --> 00:00:34,612
Shed. The long corridors in it are Hallway spaces;

12
00:00:34,612 --> 00:00:37,630
use the Victim Holding boards from the Core Box for them.

13
00:00:37,630 --> 00:00:39,324
Many cards refer to these types.

14
00:00:40,133 --> 00:00:44,144
Victims are saved by helicopter, which has to fly them to the Arctic Airport.

15
00:00:44,364 --> 00:00:49,288
When the Helicopter token is on its exit space, you may move it and up to three

16
00:00:49,288 --> 00:00:53,900
Victims with it onto the Arctic Station 2891 space of the Helicopter card.

17
00:00:54,120 --> 00:00:58,346
Once it has Victims aboard, it can't return to the station until it has dropped them

18
00:00:58,346 --> 00:01:02,120
at the Airport. Victims on the Helicopter card can't be targeted or killed.

19
00:01:02,933 --> 00:01:06,720
Each Helicopter icon moves it one space along the Helicopter card.

20
00:01:06,720 --> 00:01:11,424
Your main way to do that is the new Fly Faster! Action card, which costs one Time.

21
00:01:11,644 --> 00:01:16,150
Two successes fly it two spaces, one success flies it one space, and each result

22
00:01:16,150 --> 00:01:20,263
also costs you a Time. Or you can pay two Time to resolve the card again.

23
00:01:20,483 --> 00:01:24,725
Some Terror cards move it too. When it reaches the Airport, the Victims are saved;

24
00:01:24,725 --> 00:01:28,864
if that happens outside your Action phase, take the save rewards at the start of

25
00:01:28,864 --> 00:01:31,555
your next one. Then it can fly back and land freely.

26
00:01:32,367 --> 00:01:36,829
When the Frostbite icon comes up, you, every Victim, and every Enemy in an outdoor

27
00:01:36,829 --> 00:01:40,964
space gains a Frostbite token, or loses one health if they already have one.

28
00:01:41,184 --> 00:01:44,810
During each Upkeep, anyone indoors discards their Frostbite token.

29
00:01:44,810 --> 00:01:47,008
So stepping inside to warm up resets it.

30
00:01:47,228 --> 00:01:51,388
Victims killed by Frostbite still count as killed, and it can hurt the Killer too.

31
00:01:52,200 --> 00:01:56,248
If you find the Skidozer Keys, the Skidozer can take you to any outdoor space.

32
00:01:56,248 --> 00:02:00,400
It must always stay outdoors. Or, from the space just outside the Lab, place the

33
00:02:00,400 --> 00:02:02,632
Hole token to make the two spaces adjacent.

34
00:02:02,852 --> 00:02:07,198
Your Two-Way Radio lets you pay one Time to move a Victim one space, but not the

35
00:02:07,198 --> 00:02:08,719
same Victim twice in a turn.

36
00:02:09,533 --> 00:02:13,665
A few tips. Every trip is slow, so only launch the Helicopter with a full load of

37
00:02:13,665 --> 00:02:13,971
three.

38
00:02:14,191 --> 00:02:18,521
Buy Fly Faster! early, because the Helicopter is your only way to save anyone.

39
00:02:18,741 --> 00:02:23,028
Get back indoors before Upkeep to shed Frostbite, and remember the Killer freezes

40
00:02:23,028 --> 00:02:24,245
outside too. Good luck.

